-- Curated 2026-08-30.
--
-- Scope:
--   * 226 current player/player-accessible Weapon Skill resource entries through ID 240.
--   * IDs/names align with Windower/Resources resources_data/weapon_skills.lua.
--   * Normal, quest, and merit WS use their actual combat-skill acquisition threshold.
--   * Relic/Mythic/Empyrean/Ergon and serious weapon-exclusive WS use synthetic score 400.
--   * Prime WS use synthetic score 450.
--   * Novelty/joke and NPC-special WS use score 0.
